<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-VALENCIA 1 SCHALKE 1 - RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-VALENCIA 1 SCHALKE 1 - RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>VALENCIA, Spain 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Valencia of Spain and Schalke of Germany drew 1-1 (halftime 1-1) in a UEFA Cup quarter-final second leg match on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Valencia: Antonio Poyatos 45</p>
<p>Schalke: Youri Mulder 18</p>
<p>Attendance: 45,000</p>
<p>Schalke win 3-1 on aggregate.</p>
<p>Valencia: 1-Andoni Zubizarreta, 3-Jorge Otero, 5-Antonio Poyatos, 10-Fernando Gomez (14-Jose Ignacio Hurtado, 56), 18-Valery Karpin, 20-Xabier Eskurza (19-Goran Vlaovic, 56), 15-Patxi Ferreira, 21-Enrique Romero, 22-Jose Galvez, 27-Leandro, 26-Fernando Caceres (12-Ivan Campos, 56).</p>
<p>Schalke: 1-Jens Lehmann,  3-Radoslav Latal (5-Tom Dooley, 70), 4-Yves Eigenrauch, 6-Andreas Mueller, 9-Youri Mulder (14-David Wagner, 87), 10-Olaf Thon, 11-Martin Max, 19-Michael Buskens, 20-Jiri Nemec, 21-Marco Kurz, 25-Johan De Kock.</p>
</text>
